{"ts":"2026-07-12T15:39:50.570Z","author":"codex","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T15:39:50.570Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-12T15:39:50.570Z","author":"codex","text":"GitHub review follow-up: Gemini timer/spawn findings and CodeRabbit binary findings resolved. The runner now clears escalation timers, converts synchronous spawn failures to structured results, caches packaged resolution, and invokes the JavaScript CLI entry through node on Windows. Full 68-test/type/build/audit/container gate passes."}]}],"before_hash":"9ebc08dbb83879414412f6f4198278479197e3029d9e74350960dd0c07c0a7cc","after_hash":"d98ca61221e360f5707535f4e538e0dcba780e1817254f5bccaaeb7406afcdf7"}
{"ts":"2026-07-12T16:41:55.549Z","author":"codex","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-12T16:41:55.548Z","author":"codex","text":"2026-07-12 Gemini follow-up: fixed a semaphore slot-handoff race where a new acquire could steal capacity already promised to the oldest waiter. The semaphore now transfers an occupied slot directly and only decrements active capacity when no waiter exists; a deterministic regression test reproduces the microtask interleaving."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T16:41:55.549Z"}],"before_hash":"d98ca61221e360f5707535f4e538e0dcba780e1817254f5bccaaeb7406afcdf7","after_hash":"aa9c965ead59a4f44aec0688edeb90a2c9bae3ba28a882268b2c791e90efa01e","message":"Document semaphore handoff fix"}
{"ts":"2026-07-12T16:41:56.941Z","author":"codex","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-12T16:41:56.934Z","author":"codex","text":"2026-07-12 project initialization follow-up: failed pm initialization now best-effort removes its newly created project directory before deleting the database row, preventing orphaned bind-mounted data while ensuring a cleanup exception cannot block DB rollback."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T16:41:56.941Z"}],"before_hash":"aa9c965ead59a4f44aec0688edeb90a2c9bae3ba28a882268b2c791e90efa01e","after_hash":"a6ae959cd4441af9aa784b61fd12714512556f060b40cc1d89cd3ba18a64a7fb","message":"Document failed initialization cleanup"}
